+| `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL` | `BANCO_WEB_URL` |
+| `NEXT_PUBLIC_MARKET_URL` | `BANCO_WEB_MARKET_URL` (prefer `/market/`) |
+| `NEXT_PUBLIC_ADMIN_URL` | `BANCO_WEB_ADMIN_URL` (prefer `/admin/`) |
